<Tunnel title="Drive Checks | Save My Gig!" status="Quick_Fix">
  <div class="review-flag">DRAFT, review pending.</div>
  <div class="step-label">Step 1b</div>
  <h2 style="margin-bottom:1rem">The computer doesn't see it. Quick checks:</h2>

  <ul class="checklist">
    <li>Different USB port, plugged in <strong>directly</strong> (no hub).</li>
    <li>Another computer if one is around.</li>
    <li>If it asks "do you want to format?" - <strong>say NO.</strong> Your files are still there.</li>
  </ul>

  <p class="question">Can any computer see the files now?</p>

  <Choice step="qf_dead_checks"
    a={{ href: '/protocol/quick-fix/rekordbox-check', label: 'YES - FILES VISIBLE' }}
    b={{ href: '/protocol/quick-fix/fresh-usb', label: 'NO - DRIVE STAYS DEAD', desc: 'We build tonight\'s USB on a different drive. Recovery of this one comes after the gig.' }}
  />
</Tunnel>
